    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Life ain\u2019t hoppin\u2019 easy for Frolein the frog and her mech, Iron Tadpole. Fight evil insectoids and invaders by collecting cards and building customizable mechs through card battles in this steampunk-inspired roguelike deckbuilder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2291210/extras/606de0ef9f5637f17377e3b86184c89c.poster.avif?t=1748886633\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2291210/extras/606de0ef9f5637f17377e3b86184c89c.webm?t=1748886633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2291210/extras/606de0ef9f5637f17377e3b86184c89c.mp4?t=1748886633\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Get In The Mech, tadpole</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By gathering and building your deck with equipment cards, you can play them to change your mech and gain attributes for combat. Using all five limbs from one specific set will grant you special bonuses! The beating heart of mechs, engines, can also be swapped out. Different engines have different bonuses, like granting more fuel or allowing you to draw more cards.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2291210/extras/7c6e4de0c529dc7c0089451454253757.poster.avif?t=1748886633\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2291210/extras/7c6e4de0c529dc7c0089451454253757.webm?t=1748886633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2291210/extras/7c6e4de0c529dc7c0089451454253757.mp4?t=1748886633\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Fortune Favors The Bold\u2026 And The Strategic</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Did you draw a supremely unhelpful card in battle? There\u2019s a chance to turn the tides around with the refuel system. Playing cards or upgrading your engine requires spending fuel. So if you receive a hand you\u2019re not happy about, this flexible system allows recycling of the card into fuel and opportunity.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2291210/extras/54ed4c1da0f731c84b8e1977e19f4515.poster.avif?t=1748886633\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2291210/extras/54ed4c1da0f731c84b8e1977e19f4515.webm?t=1748886633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2291210/extras/54ed4c1da0f731c84b8e1977e19f4515.mp4?t=1748886633\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>The Endless Pond</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shrouded in fog, each level requires players to navigate through puzzles, treasures, and enemies. All movement requires movement points and restart points. Not having enough of either will move players closer to losing the run and needing to restart. After every 10 levels, an even bigger threat will approach: bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2291210/extras/fc5f1ef97a40aa9f3fa83d5f444e7714.poster.avif?t=1748886633\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2291210/extras/fc5f1ef97a40aa9f3fa83d5f444e7714.webm?t=1748886633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2291210/extras/fc5f1ef97a40aa9f3fa83d5f444e7714.mp4?t=1748886633\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mechjestic is in development, thanks to the support and funding from:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2291210/extras/7d219b3295e5381d30d375ba81b59c15.avif?t=1748886633\" /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Life ain\u2019t hoppin\u2019 easy for Frolein the frog and her mech, Iron Tadpole. Fight evil insectoids and invaders by collecting cards and building customizable mechs through card battles in this steampunk-inspired roguelike deckbuilder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2291210/extras/606de0ef9f5637f17377e3b86184c89c.poster.avif?t=1748886633\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2291210/extras/606de0ef9f5637f17377e3b86184c89c.webm?t=1748886633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2291210/extras/606de0ef9f5637f17377e3b86184c89c.mp4?t=1748886633\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Get In The Mech, tadpole</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By gathering and building your deck with equipment cards, you can play them to change your mech and gain attributes for combat. Using all five limbs from one specific set will grant you special bonuses! The beating heart of mechs, engines, can also be swapped out. Different engines have different bonuses, like granting more fuel or allowing you to draw more cards.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2291210/extras/7c6e4de0c529dc7c0089451454253757.poster.avif?t=1748886633\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2291210/extras/7c6e4de0c529dc7c0089451454253757.webm?t=1748886633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2291210/extras/7c6e4de0c529dc7c0089451454253757.mp4?t=1748886633\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Fortune Favors The Bold\u2026 And The Strategic</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Did you draw a supremely unhelpful card in battle? There\u2019s a chance to turn the tides around with the refuel system. Playing cards or upgrading your engine requires spending fuel. So if you receive a hand you\u2019re not happy about, this flexible system allows recycling of the card into fuel and opportunity.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2291210/extras/54ed4c1da0f731c84b8e1977e19f4515.poster.avif?t=1748886633\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2291210/extras/54ed4c1da0f731c84b8e1977e19f4515.webm?t=1748886633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2291210/extras/54ed4c1da0f731c84b8e1977e19f4515.mp4?t=1748886633\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>The Endless Pond</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shrouded in fog, each level requires players to navigate through puzzles, treasures, and enemies. All movement requires movement points and restart points. Not having enough of either will move players closer to losing the run and needing to restart. After every 10 levels, an even bigger threat will approach: bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2291210/extras/fc5f1ef97a40aa9f3fa83d5f444e7714.poster.avif?t=1748886633\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2291210/extras/fc5f1ef97a40aa9f3fa83d5f444e7714.webm?t=1748886633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2291210/extras/fc5f1ef97a40aa9f3fa83d5f444e7714.mp4?t=1748886633\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mechjestic is in development, thanks to the support and funding from:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2291210/extras/7d219b3295e5381d30d375ba81b59c15.avif?t=1748886633\" /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Hop in the mech, tadpole. Mechjestic is a steampunk-inspired (f)roguelike deckbuilder where you customize and build mechs through card battles. Defeat insectoids with strategic planning, turn unlucky card draws into opportunity via a unique refuel system, and save your timeline from invaders.",
